From 8f7722bd8955de828a5334ad54becba4522995ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: upsoft <13884634+upsoftt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 21:33:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 09/12] LeadSearcher: protected content unlocked for the team

The team build (TGTEAM_UNLOCK_PROTECTED, build.ps1 -UnlockProtected) lets
save, copy and forward posts of any channel or group with content
protection; the publicly distributed build unlocks it only for admins.
allowsForwarding() still reports the real setting for the settings box,
buttons check allowsForwardingForMe().

The server refuses to forward protected messages and to reuse their
files, so such posts are sent as copies (api/api_protected_copy.cpp):
media is downloaded to %TEMP%\TelegramTeam\copies and uploaded again,
albums stay albums, voice stays voice, text keeps its formatting.
